      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Apart from monoclonal antibodies against cytoskeleton proteins, polyclonal antibodies to gamma-globulin and immunoglobulin G were used. Mosaicism of myocardial damage was observed: the intermittence of acute necrosis foci with areas of ischemia and normal myocardium. Desmin may serve a marker of early necrosis in the myocardium."},
